# Keep secrets, local data and build output out of images
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.output
**/.wxt
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/web/media
dist
.git
# video package: samples, bundles and generated media are rebuilt inside the image
packages/video/out
packages/video/build
packages/video/fixtures/images
packages/video/public/fixtures-images
packages/video/public/audio/*.wav
